  "body": "## Summary\nPer UMR-20260805-153813-767f, escalated to priority-one-within-priority-one by UMR-20260805-154255-af7d: 3 real, independently re-runnable check scripts for GTM certification categories 12 (database testing), 4 (API testing), 14 (governance testing), plus the shared canonical writer `gtm_write_category_result.py` they call through (also used by the parallel static-analysis/security-audit/documentation-audit trio).\n\nAll 3 already executed against real live state and independently verified by direct DB read (not just script stdout): **all PASS**.\n\n- **Database testing**: live read-only `information_schema` queries against production Supabase, correct per-table schema (compliance vs platform, verified against schema.ts).\n- **API testing**: real curl checks against 7 live public projexa-ai.com endpoints. No authenticated route touched.\n- **Governance testing**: replaces a prior narrated passed=1 (reverted under UMR-20260805-152508-d4c9) with 2 real mechanical checks, including a live functional probe of the zero-duplication guarantee.\n\nRelated: UMR-20260802-165606-4413 (OCID-020), PR #62 (schema + migration)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
